mmary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.8 dev4 and `master`\n- Not reproducible in 4.8 dev3 and earlier\n\n### System information\n\nReproducible on Android 16, Android 17, Android XR 14\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen `interface/editor/appearance/collapse_main_menu` is disabled for the Android editor, the workspace and playtests buttons sections do not expand to fill the width of the screen, but instead are squished together in the center of the screen.\n\nSee highlighted section in screenshot\n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1600\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/042dbcd8-590b-495d-a86a-7471b5b4033e\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Launch a project in the Android editor\n- By default, `interface/editor/appearance/collapse_main_menu` is enabled for the Android editor, so navigate to the Editor Settings, and disable the option.\n- Reload the project via `Project` -> `Reload Current Project`\n- Notice that the workspace and playtests buttons sections are squished together.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSee repro steps.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://a